# `--deploy` traces the constructor itself and stops.
# REQUIRES: soldb
# RUN: %soldb run %{ethdebug_dir}/TestContract.bin --deploy --ethdebug-dir 0x5FbDB2315678afecB367f032d93F642f64180aa3:TestContract:%{ethdebug_dir} --raw --max-steps 6 2>&1 | FileCheck %s
# Under `--deploy`, `--value` funds the constructor; this one is not payable and reverts.
# RUN: %soldb run %{ethdebug_dir}/TestContract.bin --deploy --value 1 --ethdebug-dir 0x5FbDB2315678afecB367f032d93F642f64180aa3:TestContract:%{ethdebug_dir} 2>&1 | FileCheck --check-prefix=PAYABLE %s

# CHECK: Deploying locally to 0x5fbdb2315678afecb367f032d93f642f64180aa3
# CHECK: Execution trace
# CHECK: PUSH1
# CHECK: MSTORE
# CHECK: CALLVALUE

# PAYABLE: Deploying locally to
# PAYABLE: Status: REVERTED
